  "how_each_number_was_obtained": {
    "first_tile_id": "pmtiles.ZxyToID(z, 0, 0)",
    "last_tile_id": "pmtiles.ZxyToID(z+1, 0, 0) - 1, and the (x,y) recorded against it comes back from pmtiles.IDToZxy of that id, so the coordinate is go-pmtiles' answer and not mine",
    "parent_id": "pmtiles.ParentID(tile_id); it is only meaningful for z >= 1, and the value stored against the z=0 tile is a zero placeholder, not a measurement",
    "roundtrip_ok": "roundtrip_z/x/y == z/x/y, computed by the dump program, not by go-pmtiles",
    "roundtrip_z/x/y": "pmtiles.IDToZxy(tile_id), reported so each pair carries its own check",
    "tile_count": "last_tile_id - first_tile_id + 1, arithmetic done by the dump program",
    "tile_id": "pmtiles.ZxyToID(z, x, y)  (pmtiles/tile_id.go)"
  },
